			"Message": "refactor(Vine): Streamline client module documentation and timeouts\n\nRemove outdated synthesis comments and reformat documentation in `Source/Client/` modules to improve clarity. Clarify timeout behavior in `SendRequest` and refine references to default timeout constants. Update module-level documentation to reflect current behavior without verbose historical context.\n\nThis reduces noise in the documentation while preserving all technical accuracy for implementers.",
