			"Message": "docs(Vine): Remove LaTeX encoding artifact from funding header\n\nCorrect the section header 'Funding & Acknowledgements' in README.md by removing the unnecessary LaTeX-style encoding sequence `&#x2001;` preceding the emoji. The plain space and standard UTF-8 emoji are sufficient and consistent with the rest of the document's formatting.\n\nThis ensures the header renders correctly across all Markdown viewers without extraneous whitespace or encoding noise, maintaining the visual cleanliness established in recent documentation updates.",
